  "extract_html": "<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><div class=\"ib-wrap\" style=\"width:350px\">\n   \n<aside role=\"region\" class=\"portable-infobox pi-background pi-border-color pi-theme-orangered pi-layout-default\">\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-item-spacing pi-title pi-secondary-background\" data-source=\"Box title\">Kinetic-Heat Conversion</h2>\n\n<figure class=\"pi-item pi-image\" data-source=\"image\">\n\t<a href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/powerlisting/images/d/d7/Charon_Fire_Force.webp/revision/latest?cb=20221013131650\" class=\"image image-thumbnail\" title=\"Charon Fire Force\">\n\t\t<img src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/powerlisting/images/d/d7/Charon_Fire_Force.webp/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/516?cb=20221013131650\" srcset=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/powerlisting/images/d/d7/Charon_Fire_Force.webp/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/516?cb=20221013131650 1x, https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/powerlisting/images/d/d7/Charon_Fire_Force.webp/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/1031?cb=20221013131650 2x\" class=\"pi-image-thumbnail\" data-relevant=\"1\" alt=\"Charon Fire Force\" width=\"270\" height=\"204\" data-image-key=\"Charon_Fire_Force.webp\" data-image-name=\"Charon Fire Force.webp\" />\n\t\t\n\t</a>\n\t\n</figure>\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-header pi-secondary-font pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-background\">Charon's (Fire Force) Second Generation power allowed him to absorb kinetic energy and convert it into heat.</h2>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"Row 1 info\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Power/Ability to:</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">Absorb kinetic energy and convert it to heat.</div>\n</div>\n</aside>\n</div>\n<p>The power to <b>convert kinetic energy into heat</b>. Variation of <a href=\"/wiki/Energetic_Heating\" title=\"Energetic Heating\">Energetic Heating</a>.\n</p>\n<div id=\"toc\" class=\"toc\" role=\"navigation\" aria-labelledby=\"mw-toc-heading\"><input type=\"checkbox\" role=\"button\" id=\"toctogglecheckbox\" class=\"toctogglecheckbox\" style=\"display:none\" /><div class=\"toctitle\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2 id=\"mw-toc-heading\">Contents</h2><span class=\"toctogglespan\"><label class=\"toctogglelabel\" for=\"toctogglecheckbox\"></label></span></div>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-1\"><a href=\"#Also_Called\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Also Called</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-2\"><a href=\"#Capabilities\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">2</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Capabilities</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-3\"><a href=\"#Applications\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">3</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Applications</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-4\"><a href=\"#Associations\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">4</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Associations</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-5\"><a href=\"#Limitations\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">5</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Limitations</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-6\"><a href=\"#Known_Users\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">6</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Known Users</span></a></li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Also_Called\">Also Called</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a title=\"Sign in to edit\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\" data-tracking-label=\"log-in-edit-section\" data-action=\"edit-section\" href=\"https://auth.fandom.com/signin?redirect=https%3A%2F%2Fpowerlisting.fandom.com%2Fwiki%2FKinetic-Heat_Conversion%3Fveaction%3Dedit%26section%3D1&amp;uselang=en&amp;metadata=article-registration-edit-article-section\" data-testid=\"log-in-edit-section\" aria-label=\"Sign in to edit\"><svg class=\"wds-icon wds-icon-tiny\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\"><use xlink:href=\"#wds-icons-pencil-tiny\"></use></svg></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<ul><li>Kinetic Heat</li>\n<li>Kinetic Heating</li></ul>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Capabilities\">Capabilities</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a title=\"Sign in to edit\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\" data-tracking-label=\"log-in-edit-section\" data-action=\"edit-section\" href=\"https://auth.fandom.com/signin?redirect=https%3A%2F%2Fpowerlisting.fandom.com%2Fwiki%2FKinetic-Heat_Conversion%3Fveaction%3Dedit%26section%3D2&amp;uselang=en&amp;metadata=article-registration-edit-article-section\" data-testid=\"log-in-edit-section\" aria-label=\"Sign in to edit\"><svg class=\"wds-icon wds-icon-tiny\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\"><use xlink:href=\"#wds-icons-pencil-tiny\"></use></svg></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>The user can convert kinetic energy into heat, and manipulate it however they please. The subject can either be transformed completely, partially, permanently or temporarily depending on what level of power the user has, with some users being able to induce and reverse the effect at will.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Applications\">Applications</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a title=\"Sign in to edit\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\" data-tracking-label=\"log-in-edit-section\" data-action=\"edit-section\" href=\"https://auth.fandom.com/signin?redirect=https%3A%2F%2Fpowerlisting.fandom.com%2Fwiki%2FKinetic-Heat_Conversion%3Fveaction%3Dedit%26section%3D3&amp;uselang=en&amp;metadata=article-registration-edit-article-section\" data-testid=\"log-in-edit-section\" aria-label=\"Sign in to edit\"><svg class=\"wds-icon wds-icon-tiny\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\"><use xlink:href=\"#wds-icons-pencil-tiny\"></use></svg></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/Kinetic_Conversion\" title=\"Kinetic Conversion\">Kinetic Conversion</a>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/Bio-Heat_Manipulation\" title=\"Bio-Heat Manipulation\">Bio-Heat Manipulation</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Heat_Manipulation\" title=\"Heat Manipulation\">Heat Manipulation</a>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/Thermal_Ionization\" title=\"Thermal Ionization\">Thermal Ionization</a></li></ul></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Kinetic_Energizing\" title=\"Kinetic Energizing\">Kinetic Energizing</a>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/Kinetic_Energy_Absorption\" title=\"Kinetic Energy Absorption\">Kinetic Energy Absorption</a></li></ul></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Personal_Heat\" title=\"Personal Heat\">Personal Heat</a></li></ul></li></ul>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Associations\">Associations</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a title=\"Sign in to edit\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\" data-tracking-label=\"log-in-edit-section\" data-action=\"edit-section\" href=\"https://auth.fandom.com/signin?redirect=https%3A%2F%2Fpowerlisting.fandom.com%2Fwiki%2FKinetic-Heat_Conversion%3Fveaction%3Dedit%26section%3D4&amp;uselang=en&amp;metadata=article-registration-edit-article-section\" data-testid=\"log-in-edit-section\" aria-label=\"Sign in to edit\"><svg class=\"wds-icon wds-icon-tiny\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\"><use xlink:href=\"#wds-icons-pencil-tiny\"></use></svg></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/Alien_Physiology\" title=\"Alien Physiology\">Alien Physiology</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Energy_Conversion\" title=\"Energy Conversion\">Energy Conversion</a>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/Ambient_Energy_Conversion\" title=\"Ambient Energy Conversion\">Ambient Energy Conversion</a></li></ul></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Heat_Generation\" title=\"Heat Generation\">Heat Generation</a></li></ul>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Limitations\">Limitations</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a title=\"Sign in to edit\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\" data-tracking-label=\"log-in-edit-section\" data-action=\"edit-section\" href=\"https://auth.fandom.com/signin?redirect=https%3A%2F%2Fpowerlisting.fandom.com%2Fwiki%2FKinetic-Heat_Conversion%3Fveaction%3Dedit%26section%3D5&amp;uselang=en&amp;metadata=article-registration-edit-article-section\" data-testid=\"log-in-edit-section\" aria-label=\"Sign in to edit\"><svg class=\"wds-icon wds-icon-tiny\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\"><use xlink:href=\"#wds-icons-pencil-tiny\"></use></svg></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<ul><li>Power may be limited to how much kinetic energy user has/can absorb.</li>\n<li>Opposing <a href=\"/wiki/Energy_Absorption\" title=\"Energy Absorption\">Energy Absorption</a> powers, <a href=\"/wiki/Ice_Manipulation\" title=\"Ice Manipulation\">Ice Manipulation</a>, and <a href=\"/wiki/Cold_Manipulation\" title=\"Cold Manipulation\">Cold Manipulation</a> can weaken user.</li>\n<li>The user may be at a disadvantage in environments with a lack of energy to absorb.</li></ul>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Known_Users\">Known Users</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a title=\"Sign in to edit\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\" data-tracking-label=\"log-in-edit-section\" data-action=\"edit-section\" href=\"https://auth.fandom.com/signin?redirect=https%3A%2F%2Fpowerlisting.fandom.com%2Fwiki%2FKinetic-Heat_Conversion%3Fveaction%3Dedit%26section%3D6&amp;uselang=en&amp;metadata=article-registration-edit-article-section\" data-testid=\"log-in-edit-section\" aria-label=\"Sign in to edit\"><svg class=\"wds-icon wds-icon-tiny\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\"><use xlink:href=\"#wds-icons-pencil-tiny\"></use></svg></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<ul><li><a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\" class=\"text\" href=\"https://avatar.fandom.com/wiki/Firebending\">Firebenders</a> (<i>Avatar: The Last Airbender/The Legend of Korra</i>) via absorbing kinetic energy from the Sun or any other heat source.</li>\n<li><a href=\"https://dc.fandom.com/wiki/Nathan_Craig_Jones_(New_Earth)\" class=\"extiw\" title=\"w:c:dc:Nathan Craig Jones (New Earth)\">Nathan Craig Jones/Coldcast</a> (<i>DC Comics</i>)</li>\n<li><a href=\"https://fire-force.fandom.com/wiki/Charon\" class=\"extiw\" title=\"w:c:fire-force:Charon\">Charon</a> (<i>Fire Force</i>)</li>\n<li><a href=\"https://community.fandom.com/wiki/c:megajouleseries:megajouleseries.com/characters/\" class=\"extiw\" title=\"w:c:megajouleseries:megajouleseries.com/characters/\">Gabe Wayland/Home Run</a> (<i>Inheritors</i>)</li>\n<li><a href=\"https://marvel.fandom.com/wiki/Lucas_Bishop_(Earth-1191)\" class=\"extiw\" title=\"w:c:marvel:Lucas Bishop (Earth-1191)\">Lucas Bishop</a> (<i>Marvel Comics</i>)</li>\n<li><a href=\"https://rwby.fandom.com/wiki/Yang_Xiao_Long\" class=\"extiw\" title=\"w:c:rwby:Yang Xiao Long\">Yang Xiao Long</a> (<i>RWBY</i>)</li></ul>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20260802012547\nCache expiry: 1209600\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: [show‐toc]\nCPU time usage: 0.021 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.033 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 105/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 89/2097152 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 148/2097152 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 4/100\nExpensive parser function count: 0/100\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 28/5000000 bytes\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.00%    9.682      1 Template:Infobox\n100.00%    9.682      1 -total\n-->\n\n<!-- Saved in parser cache with key 1.43.9_prod_powerlisting:pcache:idhash:571386-0!sseVary=RegularPage!FandomDesktop!LegacyGalleries and timestamp 20260802012547 and revision id 2803375. Rendering was triggered because: page-vi